{"4373720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OOTY : Silence Remains", "steam_appid": 4373720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four friends travel to a remote, abandoned palace hidden deep in the misty hills, searching for thrills. What starts as an adventure turns into a nightmare when darkness falls. Play as one of them, alone and hunted, and uncover the hill’s secrets to survive the night. Escape or become part of the night forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Survival Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense first-person horror focused on atmosphere, tension, and psychological fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373720/extras/23a8efd5a037e1071cd7da5ddc604732.poster.avif?t=1786778639\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373720/extras/23a8efd5a037e1071cd7da5ddc604732.webm?t=1786778639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373720/extras/23a8efd5a037e1071cd7da5ddc604732.mp4?t=1786778639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore haunted forest and caves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a massive, abandoned forest surrounded by dense forest and shrouded in mist. Explore crumbling buildings, forgotten towers, and hidden warehouse structures, each filled with environmental storytelling that reveals the location’s dark history through its decaying architecture, scattered belongings, and unsettling details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles &amp; Investigation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles to unlock new areas, uncover the location’s dark history, and find essential tools and keys needed to survive. Every puzzle is designed to push you deeper into danger while revealing disturbing truths about what happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each monster hunts differently, forcing you to adapt your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373720/extras/821948ba4b671503513081ef7d165ee2.poster.avif?t=1786778639\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373720/extras/821948ba4b671503513081ef7d165ee2.webm?t=1786778639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4373720/extras/821948ba4b671503513081ef7d165ee2.mp4?t=1786778639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every footstep, whisper, and distant noise is designed to keep you on edge. Play with headphones for the full experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your friends before dawn</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together notes, clues, and environmental details to uncover the horrifying truth behind the palace and escape the place before dawn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four friends travel to a remote, abandoned palace hidden deep in the misty hills, searching for thrills. What starts as an adventure turns into a nightmare when darkness falls. Play as one of them, alone and hunted, and uncover the hill’s secrets to survi